== OPEN comparison becomes Standing <j2-open-standing>

The production carrier stores a noncommuting comparison as both complete paths plus its optional
exact residual. OPEN is therefore material structure rather than a flag or blacklist. In one host
cell, an equal-hand opening crossed native rest and a later exact matching boundary RIDEd without
rewriting the earlier scope. In another, earlier OPEN Standing participated in a later actual
regional contact, changed the successor relative to a no-opening sibling, and still remained OPEN
because the new comparison did not commute.

The rejected preconditions are scientifically important. A second timestamp alone did not create
incidence. After real later contact was supplied, mismatch was not tuned away or regraded as
FOUND. This separates chronology, incidence, comparison, and closure in the running machine.

